{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRANDPA'S DYING WISH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final will is clear: We must lower Grandpa and his capsule to the very bottom of the ocean! Four players must work together to keep this steel coffin intact and plunge into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/99a5bba802bc33a0e3b86ae0ca548a34.poster.avif?t=1773741823\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/99a5bba802bc33a0e3b86ae0ca548a34.webm?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/99a5bba802bc33a0e3b86ae0ca548a34.mp4?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WINCHES AND ROPE SYSTEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure the capsule to the environment using a shared pool of 50 meters of rope from its 4 corners. Using the winch mechanic, you can tighten or shorten the ropes, guiding the capsule entirely through physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/5b0296f6d0947e1495d747c2722ecff6.poster.avif?t=1773741823\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/5b0296f6d0947e1495d747c2722ecff6.webm?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/5b0296f6d0947e1495d747c2722ecff6.mp4?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICS-BASED CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you lose control of the ropes? The capsule spins out of control, violently smashes into rocks, and takes heavy damage! Physics can be your best friend, or the end of Grandpa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/1f077f65c89f1cd03f77962fc7d6b728.poster.avif?t=1773741823\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/1f077f65c89f1cd03f77962fc7d6b728.webm?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/1f077f65c89f1cd03f77962fc7d6b728.mp4?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOULDER TO SHOULDER CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the capsule's outer armor shatters, teamwork is your only hope. Share resources with your friends and use your repair kit fuel to fix the capsule through the hologram interface to keep moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/3f2e939e0d80475c9ed8dd50d1629587.poster.avif?t=1773741823\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/3f2e939e0d80475c9ed8dd50d1629587.webm?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/3f2e939e0d80475c9ed8dd50d1629587.mp4?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCAVENGE AND FEED GRANDPA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the ocean floor for supply boxes to find medkits, harpoons, and food. Survival isn't just about you; if you don't feed Grandpa through his special feeding slot with the food you find, it's game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/2c7c9c127133367217cdeddde9732996.poster.avif?t=1773741823\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/2c7c9c127133367217cdeddde9732996.webm?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/2c7c9c127133367217cdeddde9732996.mp4?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEWARE OF ENVIRONMENTAL HAZARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean isn't just empty rocks. Remnants of the old world, industrial leaks, and deadly naval mines are waiting to blow your capsule to pieces. Watch your surroundings carefully while winching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/970baf1e9b248c404acbc7182fb0d99f.poster.avif?t=1773741823\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/970baf1e9b248c404acbc7182fb0d99f.webm?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/970baf1e9b248c404acbc7182fb0d99f.mp4?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILDLIFE AND UNEXPECTED DEATHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from sharks that want to swallow you whole... and pray your panicking friends don't headbutt a naval mine! Remember: dead players come back as fish to completely troll the survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/294a19844362c51f6449d12193b41fc1.poster.avif?t=1773741823\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/294a19844362c51f6449d12193b41fc1.webm?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/294a19844362c51f6449d12193b41fc1.mp4?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMING IN THE FULL RELEASE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Brand New Underwater Biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Distinct Fish / Enemy AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ New Items &amp; Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harpoon System &amp; Underwater Scooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly Environmental Hazards (Geysers, mines, leaks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment Interactions (Oxygen stations, propeller fans, gates)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization &amp; Emotes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Grandpa Animations &amp; Reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectate (Fish) Mode for Trolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat &amp; Renewed Audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Pre-Match Lobby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ping System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855810?t=1773741823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/98838dcdf7af3856a3fcf95867b49d7555f91811/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773741823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/988192aadf54daf2799ef595c4e77181c87e4204/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773741823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/988192aadf54daf2799ef595c4e77181c87e4204/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773741823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4434340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRANDPA'S DYING WISH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final will is clear: We must lower Grandpa and his capsule to the very bottom of the ocean! Four players must work together to keep this steel coffin intact and plunge into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/99a5bba802bc33a0e3b86ae0ca548a34.poster.avif?t=1773741823\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/99a5bba802bc33a0e3b86ae0ca548a34.webm?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855810/extras/99a5bba802bc33a0e3b86ae0ca548a34.mp4?t=1773741823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WINCHES AND ROPE SYSTEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure the capsule to the environment using a shared pool of 50 meters of rope from its 4 corners. Using the winch mechanic, you can tighten or shorten the ropes, guiding the capsule entirely through physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\